requirements:
To support the physical weight of the spans without active phase tension, messenger conductor ratings must strictly correlate to phase size as per Table 3: 
a) For phase sizes 16, 25, or 35 mm²: messenger nominal area of 25 mm², max d.c. resistance at 20 °C of 1.38 ohm/km, and minimum breaking load of 7.0 kN; 
b) For phase size 50 mm²: messenger nominal area of 35 mm², max d.c. resistance of 0.986 ohm/km, and minimum breaking load of 9.8 kN; 
c) For phase size 70 mm²: messenger nominal area of 50 mm², max d.c. resistance of 0.689 ohm/km, and minimum breaking load of 14.0 kN; 
d) For phase size 95 mm²: messenger nominal area of 70 mm², max d.c. resistance of 0.492 ohm/km, and minimum breaking load of 19.7 kN.
